    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1459890/extras/7d34354401777b863880246a6f7728cc.avif?t=1738662601\" /></div><br><br>Robert is the main character of the game. He is a recluse who lives in the middle of a big city. The reason why he became a recluse is a severe migraine that occurs when he sees girls.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1459890/extras/d39f4d8e419236e8a76531e1e25a09b3.avif?t=1738662601\" /></div><br>Cold Harvest is a visual novel with a unique play experience.<br><br>\u2022 free movement around the city<br>\u2022 interaction with characters and objects<br>\u2022 the change of night and day<br>\u2022 transfer of objects between locations and their collection<br>\u2022 solving riddles and puzzles<br>\u2022 dynamically developing plot<br>\u2022 mini games built into the gameplay<br>\u2022 romantic relationships with many girls<br>\u2022 horror and action scenes",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1459890/extras/7d34354401777b863880246a6f7728cc.avif?t=1738662601\" /></div><br><br>Robert is the main character of the game. He is a recluse who lives in the middle of a big city. The reason why he became a recluse is a severe migraine that occurs when he sees girls.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1459890/extras/d39f4d8e419236e8a76531e1e25a09b3.avif?t=1738662601\" /></div><br>Cold Harvest is a visual novel with a unique play experience.<br><br>\u2022 free movement around the city<br>\u2022 interaction with characters and objects<br>\u2022 the change of night and day<br>\u2022 transfer of objects between locations and their collection<br>\u2022 solving riddles and puzzles<br>\u2022 dynamically developing plot<br>\u2022 mini games built into the gameplay<br>\u2022 romantic relationships with many girls<br>\u2022 horror and action scenes",
